on.","citation_ids":["cite.long.record-257bm-c10"],"evidence_ids":["mapping.long.record-257bm-c10"],"id":"long.record-257bm-c10","kind":"claim","label":"Long record Theorem 6.78 (A finite sum from a skipped prefix)","locator":"Long record Theorem 6.78, p. 66, label record:257bm-c10","source_id":"paper.long.pdf","statement":"*Let $c\\ge4$ and $D\\subseteq\\{2,\\ldots,c-1\\}$ satisfy\n$$\n0<\\frac12-X_D(2)<\\frac1{2^c-1}.\n$$\nThen there is $E$ with $D\\subseteq E\\subseteq\\{2,\\ldots,2c-2\\}$ and $Q(E,2c-2)=2^{2c-3}-1$. No separate sharp-capacity assumption is required. The binary completion in the linked proof uses ranks $c,\\ldots,2c-2$; it may therefore insert $c$. Theorem 6.75 instead assumes the sharper $(c-2)$-bit bound so that every added rank is strictly greater than $c$.*","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c10","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c10","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c10%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_exact_row_from_skipped_prefix%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","kind":"formalizes","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22long.record-257bm-c10%22%2C%22lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_exact_row_from_skipped_prefix%22%2C%22formalizes%22%5D","semantic_class":"formalization_correspondence","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/lean.ErdosProblems.Erdos257.PaperCompleteR21.paper_exact_row_from_skipped_prefix"},{"derived":true,"family":"provenance","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/long.record-257bm-c10","id":"field:5d90ae5536c78988453f87a1244c2b056b62e0e0e1c830a24af542bcb320